<stack-static>
    <statement><p><p>The table shows the number of goals scored in each match of a county football league season.</p><tabular border="1" style="border-collapse:collapse;text-align:center;"><row><cell style="padding:4px 10px;">Goals (<m>x</m>)</cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{0}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{1}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{2}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{3}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{4}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{5}</m></cell></row><row><cell style="padding:4px 10px;">Frequency (<m>f</m>)</cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{2}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{2}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{7}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{10}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{11}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{4}</m></cell></row></tabular><p>(a) Find <m>\Sigma f</m>.</p><div><m>\Sigma f =</m> <fillin characters="4" name="ans1"/>  </div><p>(b) Find <m>\Sigma fx</m>.</p><div><m>\Sigma fx =</m> <fillin characters="5" name="ans2"/>  </div><p>(c) Find the mean, correct to 1 decimal place.</p><div><m>\bar{x} =</m> <fillin characters="6" name="ans3"/>  </div></p></statement>
    <solution><p><p>A frequency table is a short way of listing repeated values: the value <m>x</m> occurs <m>f</m> times. The mean uses every value, weighted by its frequency, so multiply each <m>x</m> by its frequency, add these products, and divide by the total frequency.</p><tabular border="1" style="border-collapse:collapse;text-align:center;"><row><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>x</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{0}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{1}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{2}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{3}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{4}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{5}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;">Total</cell></row><row><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>f</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{2}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{2}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{7}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{10}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{11}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{4}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{36}</m></cell></row><row><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>fx</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{0}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{2}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{14}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{30}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{44}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{20}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{110}</m></cell></row></tabular><p>(a) <m>\Sigma f = {36}</m>. (b) <m>\Sigma fx = {110}</m>.</p><p>(c) <me>\bar{x} = \frac{\Sigma fx}{\Sigma f} = \frac{ {110} }{ {36} } \approx {3.1}</me></p></p></solution>
    <answer><p><m>36</m></p></answer>
    <answer><p><m>110</m></p></answer>
    <answer><p><m>\frac{55}{18}</m></p></answer>
</stack-static>